{"name":"Buttermilk","hex":"#fffee4","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"buttermilk","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The liquid left over after producing butter from full cream milk by the churning process, also called traditional buttermilk.","Cultured buttermilk, a fermented dairy product produced from cow's milk, with a characteristically sour taste."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/buttermilk"}],"entries":[{"title":"Buttermilk","blocks":[{"text":"Buttermilk is a dairy drink made by adding lactic acid bacteria to milk to produce a fermented dairy drink. Traditionally, it was made from the nearly fat-free milk remaining after churning butter from cream, which was cultured with natural bacteria prior to and during churning, giving a slight sour taste to the buttermilk and preventing spoilage. However, with the ubiquity of refrigeration in industrialized countries, butter in those areas is typically made from uncultured or \"sweet\" cream. Therefore, most modern buttermilk is specifically produced by inoculating fresh, pasteurized milk, and is available in different levels of fat content."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/Buttermilk-%28right%29-and-Milk-%28left%29.jpg/330px-Buttermilk-%28right%29-and-Milk-%28left%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buttermilk","wikidata":"Q106612"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"buttermilk":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/52/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-buttermilk.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/52/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-buttermilk.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-buttermilk.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/52/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-buttermilk.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-buttermilk.wav.ogg"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Ithaca - Buttermilk Falls, ca. 1905 02","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/Ithaca_-_Buttermilk_Falls%2C_ca._1905_02.jpg/500px-Ithaca_-_Buttermilk_Falls%2C_ca._1905_02.jpg","ratio":1.5880503144654088,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ithaca_-_Buttermilk_Falls,_ca._1905_02.jpg","share":0.806875},{"title":"Bouldering Buttermilk Boulders 02","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Bouldering_Buttermilk_Boulders_02.jpg/500px-Bouldering_Buttermilk_Boulders_02.jpg","ratio":0.75,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bouldering_Buttermilk_Boulders_02.jpg","share":0.19},{"title":"Bouldering Buttermilk Boulders 04","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Bouldering_Buttermilk_Boulders_04.jpg/500px-Bouldering_Buttermilk_Boulders_04.jpg","ratio":1.5,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bouldering_Buttermilk_Boulders_04.jpg","share":0.17875},{"title":"Piece of chocolate cake on a white plate decorated with chocolate sauce","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Piece_of_chocolate_cake_on_a_white_plate_decorated_with_chocolate_sauce.jpg/500px-Piece_of_chocolate_cake_on_a_white_plate_decorated_with_chocolate_sauce.jpg","ratio":1.4699946893255444,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Piece_of_chocolate_cake_on_a_white_plate_decorated_with_chocolate_sauce.jpg","share":0.17875},{"title":"Buttermilk pie","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Buttermilk_pie.jpg/500px-Buttermilk_pie.jpg","ratio":1.3388429752066116,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Buttermilk_pie.jpg","share":0.168125},{"title":"Latrobe White House cropa2","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/Latrobe_White_House_cropa2.jpg/500px-Latrobe_White_House_cropa2.jpg","ratio":0.787636669470143,"link":"http